{
  "id": "exchange-student-welcome",
  "title": "接待交換學生",
  "titleEn": "Welcoming an Exchange Student",
  "category": "國際交流",
  "level": "進階",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/exchange-student-welcome.webp",
    "alt": "在熱鬧的高中校門前，一位親切的台灣高中生微笑著迎接初來乍到的外國交換學生，並熱心引導對方認識校園環境與教學設施。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "At the front gate, Emily greets Mark, a "
        },
        {
          "text": "foreign",
          "wordIds": [
            "foreign"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "exchange",
          "wordIds": [
            "exchange"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " student from Seattle."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "在學校大門前，Emily 親切迎接來自西雅圖的外國交換學生 Mark。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "With a bright smile, she waves her hand and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Welcome",
          "phraseIds": [
            "welcome-to-our-school"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "welcome"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to our school!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "welcome-to-our-school"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "她帶著燦爛的微笑揮手致意，並說道：「歡迎來到我們學校！」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Emily enthusiastically offers, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let me show you around.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "let-me-show-you-around"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Emily 熱情地提議：「讓我帶你參觀一下周遭環境。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She will "
        },
        {
          "text": "guide",
          "wordIds": [
            "guide"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " him to explore each modern "
        },
        {
          "text": "campus",
          "wordIds": [
            "campus"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "facility",
          "wordIds": [
            "facility"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", starting with the main academic building."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "她將引導他探索每一處現代化的校園設施，首先從主教學大樓開始。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Pointing toward a spacious hall, she says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Here is the library.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "here-is-the-library"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "指著一座寬敞的大樓，她說道：「這裡是圖書館。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Next, she highlights the cafeteria nearby, where students gather for lunch and relax between classes."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "接著，她介紹了附近的學生餐廳，學生們午餐時間會在那裡聚餐並在課間放鬆。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Offering her full support, Emily smiles and adds, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Feel free to ask me anything.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "feel-free-to-ask-me-anything"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Emily 熱心提供全力協助，微笑著補充道：「隨時都可以問我任何問題。」"
    }
  ],
